  Text: |-
    Snap Cloud Examples connects a Specs Lens to a Snap Cloud (Supabase) backend: sign-in and tables, a shared realtime cursor, storage downloads, edge functions, camera and audio capture and streaming, and a global leaderboard.
    Step through them with Previous / Next on the panel below, then use each example's own buttons.
    Nothing reaches the cloud until a Snap Cloud project is assigned; the first step's info line says how.
